__cv"><mxGeometry x="54" y="110" width="500" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="leyenda__traz" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Trazabilidad ASR → elementos de la arquitectura&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;(★ priorizado)&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin-top:6px;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border-bottom:1.5px solid #3B4B5C;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px&quot;&gt;ASR&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border-bottom:1.5px solid #3B4B5C;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px&quot;&gt;Atributo&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border-bottom:1.5px solid #3B4B5C;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px&quot;&gt;Alcance · artefacto (relleno)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border-bottom:1.5px solid #3B4B5C;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px&quot;&gt;Participa sin modificarse (contorno)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border-bottom:1.5px solid #3B4B5C;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px&quot;&gt;Táctica principal&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border-bottom:1.5px solid #3B4B5C;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px&quot;&gt;Medida&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DBE1;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#1F4E79;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px&quot;&gt;I01&lt;/span&gt; ★&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DBE1;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Interoperabilidad&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DBE1;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Conector empresa N (nuevo) · Registro de conectores y contratos esquemas canónicos versionados · descubrimiento (alta) · Conector empresa N · hiddenImplementation : ClienteEmpresaN · adapter : TraductorEmpresaN · mapeo : MapeoEmpresaN · Registro de conectores y contratos&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DBE1;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Bus de eventos canónicos · Eventos canónicos · contrac